<title>UK: EIB sets 400 mln Dkr December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 400 mln Dkr December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN Amro and Banque Generale du Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    09.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE  S-09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.08 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
